{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "language_version": "0.1-draft",
  "description": "Cases for the compile-time job scheduler in semantics/compile-scheduler.json. Each gives symbols with the requirements their signature and body issue, the goals demanded, and the expected final states, ordered diagnostics, and recorded dependency edges. Every case must produce the same outcome under every scheduling order the checker tries.",
